cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this dataset or the index, please cite it as below."
title: "AI Sentiment Index: daily media sentiment toward AI"
type: dataset
authors:
  - family-names: Shroyer
    given-names: Brad
url: "https://sentimentindex.ai"
repository-code: "https://github.com/bradshroyer/aisentimentindex"
license: MIT
abstract: >-
  A daily index of how positively or negatively major news outlets cover AI.
  Headlines about AI from 13 outlets are scored by an LLM (Claude Haiku) for
  their stance toward AI on a scale from -1.0 to +1.0; the index is the daily
  mean. Includes every scored headline since January 2025.
keywords:
  - AI sentiment
  - media sentiment analysis
  - news headlines
  - artificial intelligence
  - LLM classification
